  "milestone_brief": "Two working-tree fixes to the old-style arXiv ID (e.g. math/0212237) ingest path, 100% broken on a fresh var/ tree. (1) ingest/ar5iv_fetch.py try_cache(): cache_dir.mkdir -> cache_path.parent.mkdir so the <subject>/ subdir embedded in old-style ids is created before write (FileNotFoundError otherwise). (2) tools/notebook_fetch.py run(): wrapped fetch_raw_tex_if_missing in try/except ValueError so an old-style id no longer aborts the whole batch with an unhandled ValueError, degrading to raw_tex_missing. Need: regression tests for both code paths (nested cache write; old-style id in a papers.txt batch not aborting, counted raw_tex_missing); make test + ruff clean; conventional-commit + GPG-signed + co-author-trailer commit. Discovered ingesting a bridgeland-stability notebook (seed list has math/0212237 + math/0307164). Diffs already in working tree.",
